{
 "id": "018d7286-c8c4-496c-b7c1-0959a448d94e",
 "page_id": "cc85e207-5bf6-4a3d-acdb-c94769296073",
 "language": "en",
 "title": "About Gabriel Mangabeira | Olympian & Growth Marketing Strategist",
 "meta_description": "From Olympic discipline to Web3 growth strategy — discover how Gabriel Mangabeira blends AI, data, and storytelling to help brands grow with precision and focus.",
 "content": "<article class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl px-4 py-8 md:py-12\">\n  <!-- Hero -->\n  <header class=\"mb-12 text-center\">\n    <h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl\">About Me</h1>\n    <p class=\"mt-4 text-lg text-muted-foreground\">From Olympic discipline to Web3 growth strategy — discover how Gabriel Mangabeira blends AI, data, and storytelling to help brands grow with precision and focus.</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <!-- From Olympic Lanes to Digital Growth -->\n  <section class=\"mb-12\">\n    <div class=\"grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center\">\n      <div>\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">From Olympic Lanes to Digital Growth</h2>\n        <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">\n          Before I ever built a marketing system, I learned what consistency really means — inside a 25-meter pool.\n        </p>\n        <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">\n          Representing <strong>Brazil at the Olympics</strong> taught me that the smallest daily habits create the biggest long-term wins.\n        </p>\n        <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">\n          That same philosophy drives everything I do today — helping teams and founders grow through systems that combine <strong>discipline, data, and creativity</strong>.\n        </p>\n        <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">\n          From <strong>Web3 exchanges</strong> to <strong>AI-powered SaaS brands</strong>, I've led strategies that attract millions of users and turn visibility into sustainable growth.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-border\">\n        <img src=\"/images/gabriel-swimming-action.png\" alt=\"Gabriel Mangabeira competing at the Olympics\" class=\"h-auto w-full object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- The Turning Point -->\n  <section class=\"mb-12\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">The Turning Point</h2>\n    <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">I didn't trade one arena for another overnight.</p>\n    <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">\n      There was a moment — between coaching sets and campaign dashboards — where I realized that growth, like performance, is predictable when you treat it as a system.\n    </p>\n    <blockquote class=\"my-6 rounded-md border-l-4 border-primary bg-muted/40 p-6 italic\">\n      \"Swimming taught me how to push limits; marketing taught me how to measure them.\"\n    </blockquote>\n    <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">\n      That's when I started designing frameworks for repeatable, measurable growth.\n    </p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- My Journey -->\n  <section class=\"mb-12\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">My Journey</h2>\n    <div class=\"mt-6 space-y-6\">\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\">\n        <div class=\"p-6\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 font-bold text-primary\">2008</div>\n            <div>\n              <h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Olympic Games</h3>\n              <p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Consistency beats intensity.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\">\n        <div class=\"p-6\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 font-bold text-primary\">2015</div>\n            <div>\n              <h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Neil Patel Brasil</h3>\n              <p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">SEO is strategy, not shortcuts.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\">\n        <div class=\"p-6\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 font-bold text-primary\">2019</div>\n            <div>\n              <h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Binance LATAM</h3>\n              <p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Scale amplifies clarity and chaos — manage both.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\">\n        <div class=\"p-6\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 font-bold text-primary\">2023</div>\n            <div>\n              <h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Building Web3 frameworks</h3>\n              <p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Freedom comes from systems that think for you.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Behind the Frameworks -->\n  <section class=\"mb-12\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Behind the Frameworks</h2>\n    <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">\n      I'm not just building funnels — I'm building <strong>foundations</strong>.\n    </p>\n    <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">\n      Every client system follows a rhythm: → <strong>Observe</strong> → <strong>Experiment</strong> → <strong>Measure</strong> → <strong>Scale</strong>\n    </p>\n    <h3 class=\"mt-8 text-xl font-semibold\">Core Values</h3>\n    <div class=\"mt-6 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2\">\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\">\n          <h3 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-2xl font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"text-primary\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"/><path d=\"M15.477 12.89 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11\"/></svg>\n            Discipline\n          </h3>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-6 pt-0\">\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Keep the lane, trust the process.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\">\n          <h3 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-2xl font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"text-primary\"><path d=\"M12 2a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v7a3 3 0 0 0 6 0V5a3 3 0 0 0-3-3Z\"/><path d=\"M19 10v2a7 7 0 0 1-14 0v-2\"/><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"19\" y2=\"22\"/></svg>\n            Curiosity\n          </h3>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-6 pt-0\">\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Always question the obvious.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\">\n          <h3 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-2xl font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"text-primary\"><polyline points=\"22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17\"/><polyline points=\"16 7 22 7 22 13\"/></svg>\n            Consistency\n          </h3>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-6 pt-0\">\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Data over drama.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\">\n          <h3 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-2xl font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"text-primary\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"/><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"/></svg>\n            Transparency\n          </h3>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-6 pt-0\">\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Growth without guesswork.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- In My Own Words -->\n  <section class=\"mb-12\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">In My Own Words</h2>\n    <div class=\"mt-6 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center\">\n      <div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-border\">\n        <img src=\"/images/gabriel-professional-about.png\" alt=\"Gabriel Mangabeira professional portrait\" class=\"h-auto w-full object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      </div>\n      <blockquote class=\"rounded-md border-l-4 border-primary bg-muted/40 p-6\">\n        <p class=\"italic\">Growth isn't about working harder; it's about designing systems that do the hard work for you.</p>\n        <p class=\"mt-4 italic\">Every campaign I build is testable, repeatable, and scalable — powered by AI, fueled by data, and driven by human creativity.</p>\n      </blockquote>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- What I'm Building -->\n  <section class=\"mb-12\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">What I'm Building</h2>\n    <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">Tools born from solving real problems:</p>\n    <div class=\"mt-6 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3\">\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm transition-shadow hover:shadow-md\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\">\n          <h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight\">Web3 ROAST</h3>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-6 pt-0\">\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">CRO audits for crypto projects.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm transition-shadow hover:shadow-md\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\">\n          <h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight\">Token Health Scan</h3>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-6 pt-0\">\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Risk assessment for blockchain ecosystems.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm transition-shadow hover:shadow-md\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\">\n          <h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight\">Growth Experiments Framework</h3>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-6 pt-0\">\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">The operating system behind my client work.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"mt-6 text-muted-foreground\">Each one started as a personal experiment — now they power results for others.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Beyond Work -->\n  <section class=\"mb-12\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Beyond Work</h2>\n    <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">When I'm not building growth systems, I'm usually:</p>\n    <ul class=\"mt-4 space-y-2 text-muted-foreground\">\n      <li>🏊‍♂️ Free-diving or open-water swimming</li>\n      <li>✍️ Writing frameworks on Medium</li>\n      <li>🤝 Mentoring Web3 founders and creators</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">Because systems don't kill creativity — they sustain it.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Let's Collaborate -->\n  <section class=\"mb-12\">\n    <div class=\"rounded-lg border-2 border-primary bg-primary/5 p-6 text-center md:p-8\">\n      <h2 class=\"mt-0 text-2xl font-semibold\">Let's Collaborate</h2>\n      <blockquote class=\"my-4 text-lg italic text-muted-foreground\">Ready to turn your marketing into a measurable growth system?</blockquote>\n      <div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4\">\n        <a href=\"/#how-i-help\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90 h-10 px-4 py-2\">Work With Me</a>\n        <a href=\"https://calendly.com/gabriel-mangabeira/15min\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 border border-input bg-background hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground h-10 px-4 py-2\">Book a Call</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Follow My Work -->\n  <section>\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Follow My Work</h2>\n    <div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-4\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/mangabeira/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center text-primary hover:underline\">\n        LinkedIn <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"ml-1 h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg>\n      </a>\n      <a href=\"https://medium.com/@gmangabeira\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center text-primary hover:underline\">\n        Medium <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"ml-1 h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg>\n      </a>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/gmangabeira\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center text-primary hover:underline\">\n        GitHub <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"ml-1 h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg>\n      </a>\n      <a href=\"https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gabriel_Mangabeira\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center text-primary hover:underline\">\n        Wikipedia <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"ml-1 h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</article>",
